/extras/6dcc38738c9816a2ee6d6a3c2a6cfd51.mp4?t=1773432341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plan the best you can, and learn to adapt on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Design supply chains assigning helpers to each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Optimize routes, balance production times and decide when it\u2019s best to reinvest to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/f7b1112cb12861ac1ddc9be72aa17814.poster.avif?t=1773432341\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=840 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/f7b1112cb12861ac1ddc9be72aa17814.webm?t=1773432341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/extras/f7b1112cb12861ac1ddc9be72aa17814.mp4?t=1773432341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The bigger the island, the more fragile your system will become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Oceanic Rails will arrive in Early Access. Thanks for your support on this project from the early stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We are planning to expand the game with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Flowers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More Production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bigger product trees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And more..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each update will aim to improve and expand on the game, without losing the core focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Extrinc Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/18316434e91a4a1c8fa34005aa7a96828a5610f0/header.jpg?t=1773432341","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13, macOS 10.15, macOS 13.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1+ or Intel Core 2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1+ or Intel Core 2<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full OpenGL 4.6 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Oceanic Rails","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  x86_64 CPU or ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support or Direct3D 11 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">