3913f708210e2da955.600x338.jpg?t=1773432341"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/96bff927ceee7fb4a593e601cc85c20c38fa2d72/ss_96bff927ceee7fb4a593e601cc85c20c38fa2d72.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773432341","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/96bff927ceee7fb4a593e601cc85c20c38fa2d72/ss_96bff927ceee7fb4a593e601cc85c20c38fa2d72.600x338.jpg?t=1773432341"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/786fe9db0e36dcd2068112e6df8904ee268f70f4/ss_786fe9db0e36dcd2068112e6df8904ee268f70f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773432341","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/786fe9db0e36dcd2068112e6df8904ee268f70f4/ss_786fe9db0e36dcd2068112e6df8904ee268f70f4.600x338.jpg?t=1773432341"}],"short_description":"Build, create and manage your island! Combine crops, animals and helpers with unique modifiers and upgrades. Play a farming rougelike, where each run has different possibilities, with challenging weather and week-end rent, or build you island worry free and create a beautiful pixel art world.","steam_appid":3132700,"support_info":{"email":"info@extrinc.com","url":"https://www.extrinc.com/support"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":"https://www.extrinc.com"}